      "code": "H04N21/631",
      "level": 10,
      "parent": "H04N21/63",
      "ja": "｛マルチモード伝送，例．異なる伝送経路上にコンテンツの基礎層および強化層を伝送する，または異なるエラー修正，異なるキーもしくは異なる伝送プロトコルで伝送するもの｝",
      "en": "{Multimode Transmission, e.g. transmitting basic layers and enhancement layers of the content over different transmission paths or transmitting with different error corrections, different keys or with different transmission protocols}",
      "count": 931,
      "ipcCode": "H04N21/63",
      "coreCode": "H04N21/63",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_H04N.txt",
